  "articleBody": "Before requesting kitchen renovation proposals, measure the existing room, document utility locations, define how the space must function, and prepare a prioritized list of improvements. Gather inspiration, appliance specifications, property information, and a working budget so a design-build team can develop a clearer scope, identify permitting questions, and price the work more accurately.",
